nomictimes.indiatimes.com/markets/stocks/news/fiis-cut-stake-in-10-smallcap-stocks-for-3-consecutive-quarters-shares-fall-up-to-70-in-cy26/slideshow/135680171.cms</link><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://img.etimg.com/photo/msid-135680015,imgsize-2087261.cms" length="0"/><guid>https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/markets/stocks/news/fiis-cut-stake-in-10-smallcap-stocks-for-3-consecutive-quarters-shares-fall-up-to-70-in-cy26/slideshow/135680171.cms</guid><pubDate>Mon, 09 Nov 2026 16:40:47 +0530</pubDate></item><item><title><![CDATA[Explained: Why Nvidia shares dropped 4% in overnight trade and what analysts warn can trigger a bloodbath?]]> </title><description><![CDATA[Nvidia shares dropped over 4% after CEO Jensen Huang acknowledged an affair with Alice Huang. Jensen Huang's relationship with Alice, a Chinese national, raised security concerns following intelligence reports. Nvidia has initiated an investigation into these allegations, although the board believes no secrets were compromised. Analysts suggest the company's upcoming earnings report will be crucial for market sentiment. Concerns linger over Huang's position if further evidence of wrongdoing emerges.]]> </description><link>https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/markets/stocks/news/explained-why-nvidia-shares-dropped-4-in-overnight-trade-and-what-analysts-warn-can-trigger-a-bloodbath/articleshow/135674705.cms</link><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://img.etimg.com/photo/msid-135674705,imgsize-202960.cms" length="0"/><guid>https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/markets/stocks/news/explained-why-nvidia-shares-dropped-4-in-overnight-trade-and-what-analysts-warn-can-trigger-a-bloodbath/articleshow/135674705.cms</guid><pubDate>Mon, 09 Nov 2026 13:00:59 +0530</pubDate></item><item><title><![CDATA[Nuvama Wealth Management Q2 Results: Profit rises 19% YoY to Rs 304 crore]]> </title><description><![CDATA[Nuvama Wealth Management Ltd achieved a consolidated net profit of Rs 303.5 crore for Q2 FY27. The company saw a revenue increase of 20.35% to Rs 1,366 crore for the same quarter. Client assets reached Rs 5.5 lakh crore, reflecting a 25% year-on-year growth. Wealth management, asset services, and capital markets drove this substantial growth. The company demonstrated strong operating profits with a return on equity remaining robust at 29%.]]> </description><link>https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/markets/stocks/news/nuvama-wealth-management-q2-results-profit-rises-19-yoy-to-rs-304-crore/articleshow/135673703.cms</link><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://img.etimg.com/photo/msid-135673703,imgsize-5896.cms" length="0"/><guid>https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/markets/stocks/news/nuvama-wealth-management-q2-results-profit-rises-19-yoy-to-rs-304-crore/articleshow/135673703.cms</guid><pubDate>Mon, 09 Nov 2026 12:09:56 +0530</pubDate></item><item><title><![CDATA[Citi bullish on Indian equities, sees Nifty at 28,000 by end-2027]]> </title><description><![CDATA[Citi Research projects that India's benchmark Nifty 50 index could hit 28,000 points by the end of 2027. This forecast is based on strong earnings prospects and falling oil prices. Recent foreign portfolio investor activity has contributed significantly to the positive sentiment in the equity market. Additionally, lower oil prices could improve macroeconomic conditions and reduce inflation rates in India.]]> </description><link>https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/markets/stocks/news/citi-bullish-on-indian-equities-sees-nifty-at-28000-by-end-2027/articleshow/135671094.cms</link><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://img.etimg.com/photo/msid-135671094,imgsize-5097832.cms" length="0"/><guid>https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/markets/stocks/news/citi-bullish-on-indian-equities-sees-nifty-at-28000-by-end-2027/articleshow/135671094.cms</guid><pubDate>Mon, 09 Nov 2026 10:15:45 +0530</pubDate></item><item><title><![CDATA[Coal India Share Price Highlights: Coal India Ltd Stock Price History]]> </title><descri